Z||000000||fierobaby||08-06-2001||11:07 AM||||There was a guy who just got out of a really bad divorce with his wife. One day, he found a genie's lamp. The genie came out and said, "Hello master. I will grant you three wished but, what ever you wish for your wife gets double." The guy didn't like that part but he made a wish anyway. For his first wish, he said, "Genie, I want a house in Hawaii." POOF!!! He got one house, his wife got two. This didn't make him happy but he made his second wish. "Genie, I want 2 billion dollars." POOF!!! He got 2 billion dollars and his wife 4 billion. By now, the guy really isn't happy. The genie says, "You have one more wish left. I have to remind you, what ever you wish for your wife gets double." The guy says, "Yeah, yeah. I know." Then he stops, thinks for a few minutes and says with a grin on his face, "I got it! Genie, beat me half to death!!"<P>------------------<BR><FONT COLOR="LETTER"> AIM: Fierobaby87<BR>http://angelfire.com/sports/sfiero </FONT><BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/cfiero.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||Steve Normington||08-06-2001||11:27 AM||||My uncle was a famous magician. He could walk down the street and turn into a bar.||||reg||1
Z||000002||DecadenceR||08-06-2001||11:54 AM||||One day, a duck walked into a store, and asked the clerk, "Do you have any Grapes?"<BR>"No" said the clerk. The duck turned around and walked out.<BR>The next day, the duck walked into the same store.<BR>"Do you have any Grapes?"<BR>"No" said the clerk. The duck turned around and walked out.<BR>The next day, the duck walked into the same store.<BR>"Do you have any Grapes?"<BR>"No, and if you ask me one more time I'm going to staple your bill shut." said the clerk. The duck turned around and walked out.<BR>The next day, the duck walked into the same store.<BR>"Do you have any staples?"<BR>"No" said the clerk. <BR>"Good," Said the duck "Do you have any grapes?"||||reg||1
Z||000003||Urchin||08-06-2001||12:28 PM||||A guy is sitting at the bar, looks at the guy beside him and says, "You want to here a redneck joke?"<BR>The guy says,"I'm 6'00" tall, 215 lbs and I'm a redneck. You see bubba beside you? He's 235lbs. and he's a redneck. You see that truck driver beside him, he's 265lbs, and he's a redneck! Do you still want to tell your redneck joke?" <P>"Naw; i don't want to explain it three times!" <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/new_3.jpg"> <BR>If you can read this, I'm parked.||||reg||1
