Z||000005||JSocha||08-06-2001||01:00 PM||||Three men go to the floor observatory on the 86th floor of the Empire state building.<P>As they are up there discussing sports, weather, the views and other topics, the men get into a heated debate on who of the three was better endowed then the other.<P>One of the men comes up with an idea of taking it out and seeing how far down the side of the building it would reach to settle the argument.<P>The first guy, whips it out, hangs over the edge and proudly says, "I'm down to the 58th floor".<P>The second guy, whips it out, hangs it over the edge as well and says, "HA! Got you beat, I'm down to the 49th floor".<P>The two eventually look over to their third friend who is doing an odd yet curious dance in the corner.<P>They ask him in completely confusion, what he is doing.<P>The third man looks at the other two and replies, "Dodging traffic!".  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000006||Ken Wittlief||08-06-2001||01:13 PM||||lame joke, take two: so the man says to the Genie, I wish you would take back one of my first two wishes.<P> take three: I wish I had a really _______ <BR>  A. hairy chest<BR>  B. thick beard<BR>  C. (other)<P> take four: I wish my ex would live for a hundred more years.<P>  take five: I wish I had 20 children<P> take six: I wish I could loose 70 lbs<P>||||reg||11
Z||000007||Jaygee79||08-06-2001||01:26 PM||||A slug in the forest had spent all day gathering berries and was making his way home when he was mugged by a gang of snails. They knocked him down, knocked him out and made off with all his berries.<P>A while later he was found and aided by a very concerned monkey who asked him what had happened. The monkey told him he should go to the police, that if he gave them a good description of the culprits the chances were good that the thugs would be caught and punished.<P>Unfortunately, the slug revealed, "I'm afraid I never saw them; it all happened so fast."<BR><P>------------------<BR><FONT COLOR="purple">Jaime<BR>84SE red<BR>AOL IM: Jaygee79<BR>ICQ: 85931334</FONT><BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/jaygee79/index.html" TARGET=_blank>Jaygee79's Web Page</A><BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/pooh14.jpg"> ||||reg||1
